	"note": "Per runtime key (Bun by minor, Node by major) and e2e build cell: the cell's build time over a honey-free reference build's (packages/core/tests/e2e/build-gate.ts), from the RATIO build lines of the build and prod e2e jobs of CI runs 41477658726, 41480554092, 41483452655, 41485934548, 41489124792, 41491140178, 41494022425, 41496036286 (ci.yml dispatched with build_mode=record). Each job is classed fast, middle or slow by its own surface builds on bun, Node-only jobs unclassified; byClass is each class's median. baseline: the median of every job's ratio. ceiling (ceiling-rule.ts ceilingRule): per cell, fit log(ratio) (mean m, sample sd s), sigma_upper = s * sqrt((n-1)/chi2_0.10,n-1) (one-sided 90% upper bound on sigma), z = Phi^-1(1 - 0.02/G) with G = 42 cells, ceiling = max(worst x 1.35, exp(m + z*sigma_upper)), so the cells share a 2% per-run false-red budget. A ratio above its ceiling is REGRESSED. catches: ceiling / baseline. No retry: a red with honey unchanged is answered by a re-record (6+ runs spanning both runner classes, derived by derive-build-ceilings.ts), never a rerun. Derived --by-commit: a cell whose head-commit groups agree (each group's median within the other's range, per runner class) pools them; any other takes the newest commit's runs alone.",
